Package: DreamPlex
Version: 3.1.1
Description: Plex and Jellyfin client for Enigma2
 Optional packages, each needed by one feature only and handled by the plugin
 when missing: gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad-fragmented for transcoded playback,
 python3-pillow and mjpegtools to render the backdrop videos.
